Qwen3-TTS / qwen-tts

The model, prompt and codec code in engine/ (in particular engine/model.py,
engine/prompt.py, engine/runtime.py, engine/sampling.py, engine/codec.py and
engine/codec_dev.py) is ported from the qwen-tts package, version 0.1.1
(https://github.com/Qwen/Qwen3-TTS), by the Qwen team, Alibaba Group:

  Copyright 2026 The Qwen team, Alibaba Group and the HuggingFace Inc. team.
  Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

The Qwen3-TTS model weights (Qwen/Qwen3-TTS-12Hz-1.7B-CustomVoice) are not
included in this repository. They are distributed by their authors under the
Apache License, Version 2.0.

------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Golden references (eval/golden/)

eval/golden/golden.json, eval/golden/golden_pcm.npz and
eval/golden/sampled_reference.json were generated by running the Qwen3-TTS
model (Qwen/Qwen3-TTS-12Hz-1.7B-CustomVoice, revision 0c0e305) with the
qwen-tts 0.1.1 reference implementation on CPU (see
eval/golden/make_golden.py and eval/golden/make_sampled_reference.py).
sampled_reference.json also records word error rates measured with
openai/whisper-small.en.

------------------------------------------------------------------------------
LibriTTS (eval/data/ and the texts in eval/golden/)

eval/data/libritts_test_clean.jsonl contains the normalized transcripts of
the LibriTTS test-clean subset, and the golden references use texts from it.

  LibriTTS: A Corpus Derived from LibriSpeech for Text-to-Speech.
  H. Zen, V. Dang, R. Clark, Y. Zhang, R. J. Weiss, Y. Jia, Z. Chen, Y. Wu.
  Interspeech 2019. https://www.openslr.org/60/
  Licensed under the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International License
  (CC BY 4.0), https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

The transcripts are redistributed unmodified apart from being collected into
one JSON Lines file with their utterance ids.

------------------------------------------------------------------------------
VoxServe

eval/bench.py and eval/client.py implement the evaluation protocol of
VoxServe (arXiv:2602.00269v2, section 4 and Appendix B). No VoxServe code is
included.
